# Schema.org 結構化數據規範

## 基本原則

- 使用 **JSON-LD** 格式（Google 推薦）
- 每個頁面至少包含一個主要 Schema 類型
- 確保數據與頁面可見內容一致
- 使用 Google Rich Results Test 驗證
- **放哪些節點、`LocalBusiness` 放哪裡、`publisher` 只用 `@id`**：見 `304-generative-search-optimization`。本檔只示範語法

## 實體參照

商家 `@id` 全站固定為 `https://{host}/`，`WebSite` 為 `https://{host}/#website`。`Article`、`Service`、`VideoObject` 的 `publisher`／`provider` 只寫：

```json
{ "@id": "https://example.com/" }
```

同一頁仍要輸出商家節點本體。文章與列表頁用 `Organization`；在地服務的靜態頁才加 `LocalBusiness`（見 304）。

## 通用 Schema 元件

```tsx
// components/seo/SchemaScript.tsx
export const SchemaScript: React.FC<{ schema: Record<string, unknown> }> = ({ schema }) => (
  <script
    type="application/ld+json"
    dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: JSON.stringify(schema) }}
  />
);
```

## 網站層級 Schema

```typescript
// schemas/organizationSchema.ts
export const organizationSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Organization',
  '@id': 'https://example.com/',
  name: '公司名稱',
  url: 'https://example.com/',
  logo: { '@type': 'ImageObject', url: 'https://example.com/logo.png' },
  sameAs: [
    'https://www.facebook.com/yourpage',
    'https://www.linkedin.com/company/yourcompany',
  ],
};

// schemas/websiteSchema.ts
export const websiteSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'WebSite',
  '@id': 'https://example.com/#website',
  url: 'https://example.com/',
  name: '網站名稱',
  publisher: { '@id': 'https://example.com/' },
  potentialAction: {
    '@type': 'SearchAction',
    target: 'https://example.com/search?q={search_term_string}',
    'query-input': 'required name=search_term_string',
  },
};
```

## 頁面層級 Schema

### 文章頁面

```typescript
export function createArticleSchema(article: {
  title: string; description: string; url: string;
  image: string; datePublished: string; authorName: string;
}) {
  return {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'Article',
    headline: article.title,
    description: article.description,
    image: article.image,
    datePublished: article.datePublished,
    dateModified: article.datePublished,
    inLanguage: 'zh-TW',
    publisher: { '@id': 'https://example.com/' },
    author: { '@type': 'Person', name: article.authorName },
  };
}
```

### 產品頁面

```typescript
export function createProductSchema(product: {
  name: string; description: string; image: string[];
  sku: string; price: number; currency: string;
  availability: 'InStock' | 'OutOfStock';
}) {
  return {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'Product',
    name: product.name,
    description: product.description,
    image: product.image,
    sku: product.sku,
    offers: {
      '@type': 'Offer',
      price: product.price,
      priceCurrency: product.currency,
      availability: `https://schema.org/${product.availability}`,
    },
  };
}
```

### FAQ 頁面

```typescript
export function createFAQSchema(faqs: Array<{ question: string; answer: string }>) {
  return {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'FAQPage',
    mainEntity: faqs.map((faq) => ({
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: faq.question,
      acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: faq.answer },
    })),
  };
}
```

### 麵包屑導航

```typescript
export function createBreadcrumbSchema(items: Array<{ name: string; url: string }>) {
  return {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
    itemListElement: items.map((item, index) => ({
      '@type': 'ListItem',
      position: index + 1,
      name: item.name,
      item: item.url,
    })),
  };
}
```

## 驗證檢查清單

- [ ] 使用 [Google Rich Results Test](https://search.google.com/test/rich-results) 測試
- [ ] 使用 [Schema Markup Validator](https://validator.schema.org/) 驗證
- [ ] Schema 數據與頁面可見內容一致
- [ ] 日期格式正確（ISO 8601）
- [ ] URL 使用完整路徑（含 https://）
